<!-- GREENTIDE_MECHANICS_2 M12 build (greentide_kit_spec.md M12: "Sealant:
     RUT_ToxinSealant — a paintable per-cell mark... the cheapest honest
     route: a floor-like TerrainDef applied over the chamber floor by a
     normal construction job consuming the sealant item").

     🔴 Load-bearing correction found this pass: the spec flags the sealant
     item's own recipe chain as "owed to the items pass" (card 2), but
     RM_ToxinSealant (the ITEM) already shipped —
     src/RimMandrake/Greentide/Defs/ThingDefs/RM_Greentide_Items.xml, header
     comment "GREENTIDE_STANDALONE_MOD_1 (M12 sealant half, owner ruling
     confirmed 2026-09-11: crafted from sap/resin; the economic link is
     canon)" — crafted from RM_SapResin (also already shipped there) at
     TableMachining. It already seals M8's own RM_ChurnmudSealed via the
     exact same costList entry this def reuses below. Nothing new to craft
     or cost here; this terrain is the Greatbole's own consumer of that
     same existing item, not a second sealant economy. Item file addendum
     records this correction against greentide_kit_spec.md's stale "owed"
     note.

     RM_MapComponent_LivingRegrowth gates purely on
     `cell.GetTerrain(map) == sealantTerrain` (see RUT_GreatboleCore.xml's
     own CompProperties_LivingBoleMarker.sealantTerrain) — carrying NO
     RM_MireExtension or other marker is what makes a sealed chamber cell
     exempt from regrowth, same "no separate bookkeeping" shape
     RM_ChurnmudSealed already established for M8.

     PLACEHOLDER ART: reuses vanilla PavedTile's own texture, same choice
     RM_ChurnmudSealed already made for a sealant floor. Real bespoke art is
     owed — DEPLOY_HOLD. -->
<Defs>

  <TerrainDef MayRequire="mandrake.rm.greentide">
    <defName>RUT_ToxinSealant</defName>
    <label>toxin-sealed floor</label>
    <description>Chamber floor painted over with toxin sealant and packed down. The living wood beneath cannot push through it, or close the cut you made.</description>
    <renderPrecedence>320</renderPrecedence>
    <texturePath>Terrain/Surfaces/PavedTile</texturePath>
    <pathCost>14</pathCost>
    <fertility>0</fertility>
    <affordances>
      <li>Light</li>
      <li>Medium</li>
      <li>Heavy</li>
    </affordances>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Light</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <layerable>true</layerable>
    <designationCategory>Floors</designationCategory>
    <constructEffect>ConstructMetal</constructEffect>
    <constructionSkillPrerequisite>3</constructionSkillPrerequisite>
    <costList>
      <RM_ToxinSealant>5</RM_ToxinSealant>
    </costList>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToBuild>400</WorkToBuild>
      <Beauty>-1</Beauty>
    </statBases>
  </TerrainDef>

</Defs>
